as written

PATCH {PasswordExpiration: "1970 epoch string"}
will return 
{PasswordExpiration: null}

which will technically be a failed patch.  Just reject if this is zero.

> dateStringToEpoch("1970") will return a filled optional with a value of 0.
> Line 1149 duration casts it from 0 microseconds to 0 seconds. DBus call on line 1263 sets 0 seconds to > dbus. On GET, this will be read in and omitted.

